      "date": "0001-01-01T00:00:00",
      "body": "The badge desk preserved the request without identifying the staff member who received it.\n\nCall summary:\nCaller claimed to be an executive assistant and said a visitor needed immediate access. The caller asked staff to let the visitor piggyback through the staff entrance while the badge issue was 'fixed later'. The summary does not record whether staff followed the request.\n\nImani",
